    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I,Ravi Karunanayake, Finance Minister of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order.",
